====================================
STARTING THE EDITOR
====================================
LOAD "ADVEDITC64U.PRG",8,1
RUN

(Replace 8 with your USB device number if needed)

====================================
SCREEN LAYOUT
====================================
Top Line    : Menu Bar (File / Edit / Help)
Middle Area : Text Editing View
Bottom Line : Status, prompts, messages

====================================
MENU KEYS
====================================
F1  → File Menu
F3  → Edit Menu
F5  → Help Menu

ESC / RUN-STOP → Cancel menu

====================================
FILE MENU (F1)
====================================
O  Open file
S  Save
A  Save As
C  Close (new empty buffer)
Q  Quit editor

====================================
EDIT MENU (F3)
====================================
Y  Copy current line
X  Cut current line
P  Paste line
F  Search
R  Search & Replace

====================================
HELP MENU (F5)
====================================
A  About screen

====================================
EDITING KEYS
====================================
Cursor Keys  : Move cursor
RETURN       : New line
DEL          : Backspace

====================================
TYPING MODE (IMPORTANT)
====================================
CTRL + U  → Toggle typing mode

UPPER  : Forces uppercase letters (default)
mixed  : Mixed-case typing (keyboard dependent)

(Current mode is shown on status line)

====================================
SEARCH
====================================
F3 → F
Enter text → Jump to next match

====================================
SEARCH & REPLACE
====================================
F3 → R
Enter text to find
Enter replacement text
One replacement is performed

====================================
FILE STORAGE
====================================
Files are opened/saved using IEC device numbers.

Common devices:
8   Default (often Ultimate USB)
9+  Alternate Ultimate mappings

List directory from BASIC:
LOAD "$",8
LIST

====================================
EMERGENCY EXIT
====================================
RUN-STOP + RESTORE

